flowchart TB
    Agent["Agent 会话"]
    Bootstrap["memory_bootstrap<br/>仅 global Layer 0"]
    ScopeCatalog["ScopeCatalog<br/>安装技能 · 配置工具/仓库 · 索引项目/文件"]
    ContextQuery["memory_context / memory_query<br/>显式局部画像 · 排名与证据"]
    EightTools["8 个 MCP 工具<br/>bootstrap · query · context · log<br/>rules · history · forget · notify"]
    StructuredOutput["strict outputSchema<br/>structuredContent"]
    TextOutput["兼容文本<br/>content[0].text JSON"]
    MemoryItems["memory_items<br/>当前投影"]
    MemoryEvents["memory_item_events<br/>正常 append-only 历史"]
    MaintenanceState["每 Vault single-flight 维护<br/>pending → running → succeeded / failed"]
    CliPurge["CLI 单条 purge<br/>已归档 · 双 item id · 非空原因"]
    BackupBoundary["在 purge-backups 中创建并验证<br/>独立 SQLite 备份文件 · MCP 不提供 purge"]
    NoSchemaV6["Schema V6 量化 No-Go<br/>不创建分段表"]
    Agent --> Bootstrap
    Bootstrap --> ScopeCatalog
    ScopeCatalog --> ContextQuery
    ContextQuery --> EightTools
    EightTools --> StructuredOutput
    EightTools --> TextOutput
    StructuredOutput <--> TextOutput
    EightTools --> MemoryItems
    MemoryItems <--> MemoryEvents
    EightTools --> MaintenanceState
    CliPurge --> BackupBoundary
    BackupBoundary --> MemoryItems
    NoSchemaV6 -.-> MemoryItems
